          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A fresh start.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un nouveau départ."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A glimpse of this recording": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un aperçu de cet enregistrement"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A home for your dreams.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un refuge pour vos rêves."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A little more context": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un peu plus de contexte"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A little news, a few messages, time to think…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un peu d’actualité, quelques messages, du temps pour réfléchir…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A little nudge": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un petit rappel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A little of your routine, captured.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un peu de votre routine, capturé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A missing run stays unknown. It isn't counted as a zero-minute morning.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une session manquante reste inconnue. Elle n’est pas comptée comme une matinée de zéro minute."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A moment for you": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un moment pour vous"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A morning saved. Time still unknown.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une matinée enregistrée. Durée encore inconnue."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A morning to review": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une matinée à revoir"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A morning, remembered.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une matinée, en mémoire."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A place for what comes to mind": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un endroit pour ce qui vous passe par la tête"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A previous Apple app save was interrupted. Check Calendar or Reminders before adding that item again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un enregistrement précédent dans une app Apple a été interrompu. Vérifiez Calendrier ou Rappels avant d’ajouter cet élément à nouveau."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A proposed visual label doesn't establish an app's identity or an action you took.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un libellé visuel proposé n’établit ni l’identité d’une app ni une action de votre part."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A recorded glimpse, not time spent. These samples don't establish app opens, reads or scrolls.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un aperçu enregistré, pas un temps passé. Ces échantillons n’établissent ni ouvertures d’apps, ni lectures, ni défilements."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A recording doesn't tell us whether a person or automation caused the activity. Keep Unsure when you don't know.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un enregistrement ne dit pas si l’activité vient d’une personne ou d’une automatisation. Gardez « Incertain » si vous ne savez pas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A recording is sampled at up to 24 moments, so short clips work best and quick actions may be missed. Visible text helps suggest a routine; it doesn't reveal every tap or intention.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un enregistrement est échantillonné sur 24 moments au maximum : les clips courts fonctionnent mieux et les actions rapides peuvent être manquées. Le texte visible aide à suggérer une routine ; il ne révèle pas chaque toucher ni chaque intention."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A saved moment": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un moment enregistré"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A saved recording needs attention": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un enregistrement demande votre attention"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A saved suggestion no longer matches its sources or routine. Your current morning and observations are intact. Choose mornings to suggest a fresh update.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une suggestion enregistrée ne correspond plus à ses sources ou à votre routine. Votre matinée actuelle et vos observations sont intactes. Choisissez des matinées pour proposer une nouvelle mise à jour."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A screenshot or text file works too. You choose what to share.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A screenshot or text file works too. You choose what to share."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une capture ou un fichier texte conviennent aussi. Vous choisissez quoi partager."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A selected observation was removed. Clear the selection and choose again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une observation sélectionnée a été supprimée. Effacez la sélection et choisissez à nouveau."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A thought, a dream, something for later. Say it in your own words.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une pensée, un rêve, quelque chose pour plus tard. Dites-le avec vos mots."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A visual label is a proposal about what's visible. It doesn't establish which app was open or what you did.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un libellé visuel est une proposition sur ce qui est visible. Il n’établit ni quelle app était ouverte, ni ce que vous avez fait."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A voice to guide you": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une voix pour vous guider"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A voice’s language affects pronunciation. Choosing it does not translate your routine.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La langue d’une voix influe sur la prononciation. La choisir ne traduit pas votre routine."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A word from you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un mot de votre part."
          }
        }
      }
    },
