        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce que vous entendrez"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What's on your mind?": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "À quoi pensez-vous ?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When recording finishes, visible text is extracted and saved locally. Review the text, then choose whether to ask Apple Intelligence for a routine suggestion. Your routine changes only after you approve. The video stays on this device until its extracted text is saved, or until you discard it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "À la fin de l’enregistrement, le texte visible est extrait et enregistré localement. Relisez le texte, puis choisissez si vous voulez demander une suggestion de routine à Apple Intelligence. Votre routine ne change qu’après votre approbation. La vidéo reste sur cet appareil jusqu’à l’enregistrement de son texte extrait, ou jusqu’à ce que vous la supprimiez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whose activity is this?": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "À qui appartient cette activité ?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Why this suggestion?": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pourquoi cette suggestion ?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Within your target.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dans votre objectif."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Écrire"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write it here, use your keyboard's dictation, or ask Siri to capture it with MORE.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Écrivez-la ici, utilisez la dictée du clavier ou demandez à Siri de la noter avec MORE."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Written observation · no sampled screens": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Observation écrite · aucun écran échantillonné"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yes": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Oui"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can capture thoughts and dreams, edit a routine, and use spoken guidance even while the on-device model is unavailable.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous pouvez noter pensées et rêves, modifier une routine et utiliser le guidage vocal même quand le modèle sur l’appareil est indisponible."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You kept this longer plan. This note returns when the routine changes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous avez gardé ce plan plus long. Cette note reviendra quand la routine changera."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You kept this screen unknown. It is left out of later activity suggestions.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous avez laissé cet écran inconnu. Il est exclu des prochaines suggestions d’activités."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You reached the end of the routine.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous avez atteint la fin de la routine."
          }
        }
      }
    },
